# The group write is skipped while the obligation naming it is retired.
MODULE: IntentCoversStalePublishDropsWrite
TARGET: IntentCoversStale
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a group write is lost but the intent naming the group is retired anyway
PERTURBS: Publish

--- FIND
    /\ pub' = [pub EXCEPT ![g] = Enc(slots[g])]
    /\ intent' = [intent EXCEPT ![k] = @ \ {g}]
--- REPLACE
    /\ pub' = pub
    /\ intent' = [intent EXCEPT ![k] = @ \ {g}]
--- END
